                <pb facs="0205" n="103" xml:id="pg103"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/350.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-09-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Was informed yesterday by foreign office all treaty powers having signified their
                    assent prohibition of importation of morphia and instruments for injection,
                    prohibition will be enforced from 1st next January.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
